)\nciteturn733search7 [wordlim: 200] Content type: text/plain; \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCGV Vincom Đồng Khởi (https://www.screenviet.com/cinemainfo/hochiminh/cgv-vincom-dong-khoi-vdk)\nciteturn733search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; Content type: text/plain; \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBobbi Brown Uses This 'Miracle' Product for a 'Natural Glow'-and It's On Sale for Memorial Day (https://www.prevention.com/beauty/makeup/a71350704/bobbi-brown-jones-road-beauty-memorial-day-sale-2026/)\nciteturn733news38 [wordlim: 100] Published: 5 months ago; Bobbi Brown, founder of Jones Road Beauty, highlights her go-to product for achieving a natural glow: The Miracle Balm. Known for her \"no-makeup makeup\" look, Brown uses the balm in shades like Chic for an all-over glow and Pink Champagne as a highlighter. Just in time for Memorial Day, the brand is hosting a \"Mini Extravaganza\" sale through May 28, offering a rare discount on The Miracle Balm and other favorites. Customers can build a custom mini set from 14 of Brown’s personally selected products—including tinted moisturizers, lip colors, eye pencils, and various brushes—with increasing discounts up to 30% and a bonus gift for purchasing 10 or more minis. The promotion allows users to tailor their looks with skin-perfecting tints, blushes, and highlighters, all designed to subtly enhance features. Brown also shared tips for a complete look: hydrate under the eyes, even out skin tone with foundation, define the eyes, and highlight lips. The sale is a key opportunity for fans to try her top picks in mini sizes.\nBobbi Brown Uses This ‘Miracle’ Product for a ‘Natural Glow’—and It’s On Sale for Memorial Day\nDate: Fri May 22 10:30:00 2026 UTC\n\nBobbi Brown doesn't just give the best makeup tips-she also shares the products that she uses to create her signature no-makeup, makeup look. Perhaps not surprisingly, the Jones Road Beauty founder often turns to her brand (she's the mind behind many of the products, after all). The brand's hero product, The Miracle Balm, continues to be a fan favorite and rarely goes on sale. But from now until May 28, you can snag the best-selling product during the brand's Mini Extravaganza sale.\nAs for how Brown likes to use the hues of her \"miracle\" product? \"I use Chic all over to give my skin a cool, natural glow, and Pink Champagne I dab on the high points of my cheeks as a highlighter that catches the light beautifully,\" she explains.\nWhat makes this year's Mini Extravaganza so special, though, is that in addition to the full lineup of the Miracle Balm's 13 shades (including fan favorites like Pinky Bronze and Happy Hour), you can build your perfect custom mini set to include 14 of Brown's favorite products to create her signature \"no makeup makeup\" look: The Miracle Balm, Eye Cream, What The Foundation, Just Enough Tinted Moisturizer, Light Moisturizer Cream, The Hippie Stick, Classic Lip, Lip Pencil, Best Pencil, and five unique brushes.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nYSL Beauty | Luxury Makeup, Skincare & Fragrance Collections (https://www.yslbeautyus.com/)\nciteturn733view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.yslbeautyus.com/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 862\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn733view1 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.clarins.vn/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAH Perfumes (https://ahperfumes.vn/)\nciteturn733view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://ahperfumes.vn/\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 597\n--------------------------------------